{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_005yay_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_005yay_4000_situation", "source_sha256": "2236039c37e6de983f2493b6dc5e8ea091c759ff244efd3eaa0ea607fa113532", "ja": "音楽番組　収録後", "zh": "音乐节目　录影后", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_005yay_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_005yay_4000_place", "source_sha256": "dc2eab181b21579d24af8758a5c8880d3a25c4048161584a8837b0a8c92754ca", "ja": "控え室", "zh": "准备室", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_005yay_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_005yay_4001_p", "source_sha256": "82590e232367256d09975743ada240f73a91c3571cb35639d7157188bbf5b381", "ja": "やよい、入るぞ。収録お疲れさま……って、\nどんよりして、どうした！？", "zh": "弥生，我进去啰。录影辛苦了……咦，\n你这么消沉是怎么了！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_005yay_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_005yay_4002_005yay", "source_sha256": "a8c42d6e97fae2d567c2dbf4d81e0d25e9338d7d6eae2012c31b57bc55502c11", "ja": "うう、{$P$}……。\n私、失敗しちゃったかも……。", "zh": "呜呜，{$P$}……\n我说不定搞砸了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_005yay_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_005yay_4003_005yay", "source_sha256": "e94448456c84d0cb939124800f6b19b3db58b529b8d49f0c6ba9a0dfe055001a", "ja": "今日は、朝ご飯をいっぱい食べすぎて、\nなんだか、うまく歌えなかった気がするんです。", "zh": "我今天早餐吃得太饱，\n总觉得好像唱得不太好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_005yay_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_005yay_4004_p", "source_sha256": "09ed39b99d041aa791f66120466d1b2fa3c61f413cdd12fa67336fff5f2ae6f9", "ja": "え、そうかな。問題なかったと思うけど。司会の人も\n「元気いっぱいですねー」って、ほめてたじゃないか。", "zh": "咦，是这样吗？我觉得没问题啊，\n而且主持人不也夸奖你充满了活力吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_005yay_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_005yay_4005_005yay", "source_sha256": "d69c4de473afe099cdb85c1328d9af67a144a85789ac66ae6e007bc50d529110", "ja": "うう～……。でも～……。", "zh": "呜呜……可是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_005yay_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_005yay_4006_p", "source_sha256": "d3a8750627f8930ebfaed19e58fb6fc13e63e57fec5bdd0e80726468bca14c01", "ja": "（やよいは納得いかないようだ。これまで通りの\n仕事じゃ、満足できないのかもしれないな……）", "zh": "（弥生似乎不满意自己的表现。和往常一样的工作，\n似乎没办法满足她了……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_005yay_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_005yay_4007", "source_sha256": "02c81d14b5d9ff935ece3f16a0737eb2e3a503bdf370fa0e611c51a6b510d73f", "ja": "新しい仕事だ！", "zh": "开始新工作吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_005yay_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_005yay_4008", "source_sha256": "81eb272f1746393bd8fc548979f908d4ef8ce69710a1e3f24e80d7222207c93c", "ja": "次の仕事だ！", "zh": "准备下次的工作吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_005yay_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_005yay_4009", "source_sha256": "513bd41694b11bf30537ec23da343f3dc6acf372f33278ca7a5790e669f24966", "ja": "特訓だ！", "zh": "特训吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_005yay_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_005yay_4100_p", "source_sha256": "919729938f106141fb9421d97194bd14682322236881d07019241bc1f188efc1", "ja": "やよいは、そろそろ次のステージに進むべきかもな。\nちょっと新しい仕事にチャレンジしてみようか。", "zh": "弥生或许差不多该朝下个阶段前进了。\n就来尝试看看新的工作吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_005yay_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_005yay_4101_005yay", "source_sha256": "2e4f4d4c4e36e4485886e1acc42e3d76ee2ead40d82fcb0e29ff24fe161a808a", "ja": "え……。いいんですか、{$P$}？\nうっうー！　ありがとうございますー！", "zh": "咦……可以吗，{$P$}？\n呜呜──！谢谢你──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_005yay_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_005yay_4102_005yay", "source_sha256": "05835ecb938659f8a2357b60f468473ca31208683d4d393435e30452757b20fc", "ja": "新しい仕事……どんなのかなー。\nえへへっ、とっても楽しみです！", "zh": "新的工作……会是什么样的工作呢～\n嘿嘿，真是期待呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_005yay_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_005yay_4200_p", "source_sha256": "1144fdaaa08f32b98e7edf85ae53a0ab4fdd8eb7508fbcbd5273048e623a22a2", "ja": "納得いかないなら、また次に頑張ればいいさ。\n期待してるからな、やよい！", "zh": "不能满意的话，下次再努力就行了。\n我期待你的表现，弥生！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_005yay_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_005yay_4201_005yay", "source_sha256": "652294823d5e5302f433cee6ed60ae3fa9cdd6b861019b3a1c6e52575db7b47c", "ja": "うう……、わかりましたっ。もっといっぱい練習して、\nもっともーっと、上手に歌えるようになってみせます！", "zh": "呜呜……我知道了！我会再多多练习，\n然后把歌唱得更好更──好的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_005yay_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_005yay_4300_p", "source_sha256": "41ac4bf7da5883ddbb9cc44e5de74130d4344aa798e529ece203501d5a852257", "ja": "よし、特訓だ！　次は、やよいが心から\n納得できる歌を、みんなの前で披露しような！", "zh": "好，来特训！下次就在大家面前唱出\n弥生真心满意的歌曲吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_005yay_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_005yay_4301_005yay", "source_sha256": "4ea307f920f6919e881b7734faabe99ffae82af9ddfe5e60e637dba7fab7be3e", "ja": "わ……、わかりましたっ。\n{$P$}、私、がんばりますね！", "zh": "我……我知道了！\n{$P$}，我会加油的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_005yay_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_005yay_4302_005yay", "source_sha256": "0dbc88511beb485f10bcbf028d0f45be30873eff99d0230bc9a20856ee585d1f", "ja": "特訓に備えて、朝ご飯もいっぱい作らなきゃっ。\nあ、タイムセール、もう終わっちゃったかな？", "zh": "为了特训，早餐得做很多才行！\n啊，限时特价是不是已经结束了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_005yay_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_005yay_4303_p", "source_sha256": "3ec4282509fbf262ddcf512a7cf111fe4123c3ff2fbca329b36b997c2446db39", "ja": "（しまった……。\n必要なのは、朝ごはんを食べ過ぎない特訓か？）", "zh": "（糟糕……弥生需要的似乎是\n不让早餐吃太饱的特训？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
